==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Bobette is a seemingly chubby red bauble with darker red markings on her face and feet. She has a metal ornament cap that attaches to a hook on her head. She wears a sweater with a white fur lining at the ends and a variety of shades of green for the patterns, spread across the sweater is a repetitive cross shaped snowflake with three branches on each end. Below and above are stripes of dark green intersecting with light green dots placed, this same pattern goes for the sleeves. However, more striping is on the sleeves than the body of the sweater. When hurt by a [[Twisted]], her face has a shocked or surprised appearance. When using her [[Ability]], she appears as a large, red present with a green ribbon wrapping around each side and forming a bow on top. Her ring is white with a narrow, dark gray outline and appears to be composed of five inward-facing, brace-like shapes formed in a circle, each connected by a thin line with a spiky rhombus in the center.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Bobette is a light gray bauble with medium gray markings and eyes pie-cut on opposite sides. Her sweater is dark gray with darker gray stripes and black dots and snowflakes, along with light gray dots on the fur lining. Her present form is white with a black ribbon.
|-|Eve Sleeper=
Eve Sleeper Bobette appears baby blue with lighter markings, white cheek marks, a coral pink bauble cap, and a smile bearing teeth. Instead of a sweater, she wears a light pink tee-shirt with a darker pink present outline on the front and short sleeves. Her body is also made more visible due to this. She wears red shorts with a pattern of white snowflakes and stars spread about. She also wears a red and white striped scarf with part of it hanging behind her, along with white socks with pastel pink stripes. Her present form is sky blue with a hot pink ribbon.
|-|Holly Lace=
Holly Lace Bobette is olive green with darker markings. Her cap is a pinkish-red color and has three similarly colored holly berries with a lighter blend and two light green, ribbon-like tails. She also has holly berries centered on the collar of a reddish-pink dress she now wears, which is shaped like the initial sweater, except it has a slightly longer round skirt with a white, wavy and curled line with leaf outlines on the lower half and wider fur lining on the hem without dots like the rest of the lining. She wears long, white socks with a pinkish-red stripe on the upper half and lighter pinkish-red shoes, each with straps that have two darker buttons on each side. Her present form is reddish-pink with an olive green ribbon.
|-|Snow-Time=
[[Snow-Time Cosmetic Pack|Snow-Time]] Bobette is a silver bauble with curved eyelids coated in a shining, purple eyeshadow, giving her a rather sleepy expression. Behind her head is a large, long-ribboned bow with a purple center and a bright purple to light blue gradient, and vice versa for the tails but with teal tips. It also has a white star and dot pattern rotating in a northwest direction. The sleeveless dress she now wears, lengthened to her patternless feet, shows a similar design, also being light blue and fading into purple with a diagonally moving sparkle pattern, complete with a white decorative squiggle on the bodice and skirt. The dress also has a fuzzy waistline with strings of fluff that divide the lower half into fourths. The fur lining remains on the dress, but the upper fur lining curves downward, and the lime green spots are recolored light purple. She also wears long purple gloves that have a lighter wave and star pattern on the ends. She radiates light blue dots, sparkles, and asterisk-shaped snowflakes with two additional branches on each end. When moving, a line of more detailed dendrite snowflakes can be seen accompanied by smaller dots and crosses like the ones on her bow and dress, along with a soft light green and magenta glow representing northern lights. Her present form is light gray with a violet ribbon.
|-|Hot Chocolate=
Hot Chocolate Bobette is tan colored with lighter markings, and her upper eyelids and eyelashes are lowered, giving her a relaxed expression. She has three brown freckles on her cheeks, and her cap is now recolored the same brown. Her eyelids are also brown, but with lighter lines that give it a shiny appearance. Her sweater is brown, has brown dots, and has larger sleeves with larger fur lining. The pattern is changed to have lighter dots across the upper half, white, marshmallow-shaped squares in the center, and a wavy line lighter brown slightly below, while the rest of the lower half is lighter, separated from the wavy line by a thin, brown one. She also wears brown gloves and shoes and wide pants that have a white-tan gradient. She produces small, bouncing marshmallow particles around her which fade away quickly. Her present form is brown with a white ribbon.
|-|Golden Bauble=
Golden Bauble Bobette is yellow with darker markings and has three white freckles on each of her cheeks. Her cap is golden yellow and she wears a gold crown with six points, a red oval ornamenting each, which envelops around the cap. Her sweater is recolored red and at the lower part, it fades into a scarlet shade used for the dots on her fur lining. The pattern on her sweater now consists of two scarlet wavy lines in the center with a row of dots colored alike above the waves while a redder row is below. Her sleeves also feature this pattern. She also emits a faint golden glow, along with small golden twinkles. Her present form is red with a yellow ribbon.
</tabber>
==Personality==
Bobette is an enthusiastic and cheerful [[Toon]] who thrives in the festive spirit of Christmas. She is affectionate, playful, and constantly spreads joy to others, often making light-hearted comments and involving herself in holiday-themed activities. Bobette's friendly nature shines through in her interactions with others, whether she's encouraging friends like {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} to team up with {{CI|Ginger|name=true}} for gingerbread house-making or inviting {{CI|Vee|name=true}} to join in on cozy traditions like hot cocoa and cookies in their interactions. She is upbeat, optimistic, and seems genuinely grateful for her experiences, embodying the fun and warmth of the holiday season. Her love for Christmas is infectious, and she enjoys sharing that cheer with everyone around her. 

Although, her Twisted form's description suggests she is hiding envy, and that it breaks free in her {{CI|Twisted Bobette}}[[Twisted Bobette|Twisted counterpart]], being further proven by the fact Twisted Bobette's description says that she will go to the location of where an [[Item]] has been picked up to find whoever she deems "greedy." It was revealed that Bobette feels under appreciated and feels like she never has any time to be with her friends due to the overload of giving and wrapping gifts to children to make them happy every year. Based on her dialogue with {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, it's evident she has little free time due to this. In a note that can be found in her lore room on the [[Seasonal Room]] map, she reveals that she believes it is her own fault for feeling the way she does and hates that she feels this way.

Contrastingly to her outwardly festive spirit, Bobette feels overloaded with responsibilities that she, as one Toon, cannot handle. Revealed in "[[The Perfect Christmas]]," Bobette is grateful for the assistance of the other [[Christmas Toons]], but begins to take all the duties herself when they prove to be unable to help her. In this way, Bobette is not inherently disapproving of the others, but rather feels that she is alone and unable to be helped. She is stressed and overwhelmed, cementing her descent into becoming a [[Twisted]].

