==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first and second requirements, focus on picking up [[Research Capsules]]/{{II|Ornaments|name=true}} and extracting [[Machines]]. The Machine, Capsule and Ornament count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more {{II|Ichor|name=true}} and Ornaments.
*For the third requirement, have a Distractor [[Toon]] bring {{CI|Twisted Bobette|name=true}} to the elevator to you so you can get aggro. Playing as {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} also helps getting Research faster because of his Passive [[Ability]]. This will be easier if Twisted Bobette is on the [[Daily Twisted Board]].

