==Trivia==
*Bobette is the second chubby [[Toon]], with the first being {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, and the third being {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}, as confirmed by [[Qwelver]].<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1325977099370102877</ref> This is probably because she is the Toon equivalent of Santa, who is portrayed as chubby.
*Bobette is one of the first [[Holiday Toons]] added to the game, along with {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, {{CI|Ginger|name=true}}, and {{CI|Rudie|name=true}}. She is also the first {{Type|Main}} [[Holiday Toon]].
*Bobette had 5{{Star}} [[Skill Check]] and 2 Star [[Movement Speed]], but it was quickly swapped to 4 Star Skill Check and 3 Star Movement Speed.
**She was the first [[Toon]] to have 5 Stars in two [[Stats]] until then.
**She would have been the third Toon to have 5 Stars on Skill Check, with the first being {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, the second being {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, and the fourth being {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} and {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}} if her old stats was kept.
*Bobette is the only [[Holiday Main Character]] [[Toon]] to not have a 1 Star on any of her [[Stats]], with [[Bassie]]'s 1 Star Skill Check and [[Gourdy]]'s 1 Star Stamina and Stealth.
*Bobette is the third [[Toon]] to have 5 Star Stamina, with the first being {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}, the second being {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, and the fourth being {{CI|Blot|name=true}}.
*Bobette's name could possibly be a portmanteau of the words "Bauble", "Bobsled" and the name "Bridgette" or "Odette".
*Bobette's last name is Carolynne, after being confirmed by [[Qwel]] in a stream on 7/19/25.
**Bobette's last name is based off of {{wp|carolling}}.
*Due to her larger hitbox, Bobette cannot climb the benches in the lobby and can't hide in some small corners within some maps.
**This is not the case for her {{Skin|Golden Bauble}} [[Skin]] however.
*If you somehow use Bobette's {{AI|Bobette}}'''Precious Packaging''' inside the [[Elevator]] when [[Panic Mode]] ends, you will still die.
*Bobette has a lot of similarities to [[Dandy]].
**Bobette has a NPC/shopkeeper variant, who sells [[Holiday Toons]], similarly to Dandy, who sells base game [[Toons]].
**They are both chubby, confirmed by [[Qwelver]].
**Both of their [[Twisteds|Twisted]] counterparts have claws and are alerted by certain actions that don't alert any other Twisteds, with {{CI|Twisted Bobette|name=true}} being able to hear a player pick up an Item and {{CI|Twisted Dandy|name=true}} being able to hear a player complete a Machine.
**Bobette has a pet rock: [[Coal]], similarly to Dandy's pet rock: {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}.
***Pebble and Coal are seen to be friends.
**Bobette would've been the second Toon to have multiple 5 Star [[Stats]] before she was changed.
*Bobette shares various similarities to [[Bassie]] and [[Gourdy]].
**They are all the [[Main Character]] [[Toons]] of their respective [[Events]].
**In the Toons menu, their icons have halved gradients, with one side being the Main Character gradient and the other being their respective Event's gradient.
**They are the only Main Character Toons to not have a [[Toon Handler]].
**They have an NPC and [[Twisted]] variant.
**They, as well as {{CI|Dyle|name=true}}, are also all shopkeepers, this being the NPC variant.
***Unlike him, though, they also have a playable variant, since Dyle is only available in-game for developers and for everyone on [[Roleplay Mode]].
**They all have the same requirements to be unlocked, requiring 100% [[Research]] on their Twisted counterparts, 3000 of the Event's currency and 2500 [[Ichor]], making them the first, second, and third Holiday Toons to require Ichor to be unlocked, respectively.
**If it wasn't for her [[Statistics]] being changed, she would've been the first Toon to not have 3 Stars in any of her Stats, another similarity she would've shared with the two others.
*Bobette's Passive [[Ability]], '''Festive Aura''', cannot be stacked, meaning that being in between two or more Bobettes will give you the effect from only one of them. 
**The effects used to stack prior to the '''Festive Aura''' buff. The reason it can't stack anymore is likely for balancing reasons, as it would be able to give large amounts of speed if it could still stack.
*Bobette is the last [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] to have an in-game plush version of herself, and the third Holiday Main Character Toon to have a plush version of themself.
*Bobette's walk and run cycle when using {{Skin|Golden Bauble}}, {{Skin|Holly Lace Bobette}}, or {{Skin|Snow-Time Bobette}} is different than her other available [[Skins]]. When using any other Skin, her head wobbles when she runs and her arms are lowered nearer her hips when she walks. While using the [[2025 Christmas Event]] Skins, her head doesn't wobble and her arms are higher up.
**This disparity was originally a difference between the [[game]] Skins and [[Roleplay]] Skins.
*Bobette is the second Holiday [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] to have [[gossips]], with the first being [[Gourdy]].
**Additionally, she is the first female Toon to have gossips.
*If you enter the "Lore Room" on the [[Seasonal Room]] as Bobette, she will say "{{Text|…I don't remember leaving things like this.}}", making her the third [[Toon]], along with all the other [[Christmas Toons]], with dialogue outside of being in the [[Elevator]], using an Active [[Ability]] or finishing a [[Machine]].
*Until the second [[2025 Christmas Event|Christmas Event]], Bobette's '''Precious Packaging''' didn't show the meter of when it was going to end, while Bobette's '''Festive Aura''' used to only apply the 50% Stamina regeneration and it was only applied if any [[Toon]] was in its area of effect, with no 5 second lingering like it currently is.
*Some time shortly after the [[2024 Christmas Event]], the cooldown of 90 seconds was removed from Bobette's '''Precious Packaging''' description.
*Bobette's favorite drinks are hot cocoa and eggnog, as seen in her [[gossip]] about {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}.
*'''Precious Packaging'''<nowiki/>'s box color matches the [[Skin]] Bobette is using.
**{{Skin|Holly Lace Bobette}}, however, has 'inverted' colors to Bobette's Default Skin, even though their box colors are similar.
**The meter above the box and the glow around it are the same color for all of her Skins, green, matching her Default Skin's sweater and dialogue box.
*Bobette seems to understand [[Gourdy]]'s situation, even making sure to not mention "family" in their dialogue.
*Bobette is one of the only [[Toons]] to mention the shutdown of [[Gardenview]].
*{{Skin|Hot Chocolate Bobette}} is one of the few Skins with a unique way to get it that is not from a Shop or Cosmetic Pack: you must log in the game all days from December 14th to December 25th during the 2025 Christmas Event.
*If you look inside Bobette's box when her '''Precious Packaging''' is active, you will be able to see shield particles, the same ones that appear around a [[Toon]] when {{TI|Savory Charm|name=true}} is activated, reflecting invincibility.
*In [[Changelog|v0.14.1]], the pattern on Bobette's sweater was updated, with the tips of the "snowflakes" having points more faithful to snowflakes instead of having hearts. This led her to getting a new full render in [[Changelog|v0.27.1]].
**This made her the first eligible [[Toon]], along with [[Coal]], to have a chance to have her render updated, along with their [[Twisted]] counterparts, with the second probably being [[Dandy]], since [[Qwel]] has plans to change his render because it has an unused expression in the game.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/969934252844138499/1454470543746269410</ref>
**It's likely this change to Bobette and Coal's snowflakes was quite last minute in the development of the [[2025 Christmas Event]], as seen in a large portion of the event's new material retaining their old snowflake pattern, like [[Stickers]], Bobette's Plush, the Bobette and Coal animation in [[Bobette's Store]]'s TV, some textures in the game files, the "Snowy Adventure" [[Poster]], and the animated music video for "The Perfect Christmas".
*Bobette is the fifth [[Toon]] to appear in 2 separate thumbnails, appearing in the [[Changelog|v0.6]] and v0.14 thumbnails.
**With her inclusion in the v0.14.10 thumbnail, she is the first one to do it thrice.
*Before Bobette's Golden [[Quests]] were revealed, her third quest would have needed her to encounter the "[[Iced Over|iced-over]] [[Ichor Leaks|ichor spill]] [[Floors#Floor Events|event]]". This was likely modified as the original quest would have been too hard.<ref>[[File:Bobette old golden quest.png|250px]]
</ref>
*There is a bug where Bobette's speech sound effect (when a dialogue bubble comes up) is highly pitched, and sounds like a little *BEEP*.
*Bobette is one of the three first [[Toons]] to have official voices which appeared in [[The Perfect Christmas]] song with Bobette's voice actor being Milk In The Microwave, the other two Toons with voices are [[Rudie]] as AXIE and [[Ginger]] as Qwel.
*Bobette is mostly made out of a fragile material, most likely glass. This is evidenced in [[The Perfect Christmas]], where Bobette falls down a Christmas tree, cracking her head open and becoming a {{CI|Twisted Bobette}}[[Twisted Bobette|Twisted]].
*There is a small bug in [[Soundtrack|The Perfect Christmas]] MV where Bobette's clothes use the old texture. This is likely because the animator forgot to change the texture. This also happens to [[Coal]] and [[Twisted Bobette]].
*Inside The Perfect Christmas, some things in her lore room, and her conversation with [[Arthur]], it's implied that she is a people pleaser.
*In her interaction with [[Toodles]], it is implied that [[Rodger]] told her Bobette's full name, due to the fact that he has done this to [[Shelly]] by calling her, "Miss. Fossilian".
*In [[w:c:battlefordreamisland:Say_Hijack|BFDIA 24]], there is a scene where [[w:c:battlefordreamisland:Book|Book]] asks recommended characters who they voted for. One of them looks like Bobette, recommended by 'Profiely_edits', and appears at 5:51, though the recommended character is named "Ornament" and is male.
*She is the only [[Christmas]] [[Toon]] to be able to speak to both [[Easter]] and [[Halloween]] Toons, though this could just be because she is the Christmas [[Main]] Toon.
*She is the only [[Holiday Main Character]] that interacts with all other [[Main Character]] [[Toons]]. As [[Bassie]] and [[Gourdy]] don't interact with eachother.
*When Bobette is pulled by {{CI|Goob|name=true}} or {{CI|Twisted Goob|name=true}}, her aura ring follows her with a slight delay.
*Bobette is the only [[Toon]] to have multiple styles of dialogue bubbles, with her [[Bobette's Shop|Shop]] NPC color being a darker green than her Toon version.
*Despite [[Coal]] being a pet rock to her, Bobette still gives her a role to play, as seen in [[Soundtrack|The Perfect Christmas]], when Rudie says, "{{Text|You gave a job to the.. rock?}}". It is unknown if [[Dandy]] makes [[Pebble]] work too.
*When Bobette is inflicted with {{Debuff|ShrinkRig}}, her ring shrinks with her, but the range of which it affects [[Toons]] remains the same.

